    "faqs_json": "[{\"question\":\"What is RUMMY WEALTH and how do you play it?\",\"answer\":\"RUMMY WEALTH is a digital card game where you draw and discard to form valid sets and sequences before your opponents can declare their hands.\"},{\"question\":\"Is RUMMY WEALTH free to play and how do virtual coins work?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the game is completely free. You earn virtual coins through daily logins and winning hands, which are used to enter higher-stakes casual match rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the system requirements and size for RUMMY WEALTH?\",\"answer\":\"You need an Android device running modern software to play. The download size is around 62 MB, making it lightweight for most standard mobile phones.\"}]",
